    <profile name="Explorator Augury Web" id="4713b6fb-1f9d-4371-a8ea-0f8a970c4224" hidden="false" page="56" publicationId="21e36b7e--pubN79165" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While the Proteus is on the table, at the start of any of the controlling player&apos;s turn, before any reserve rolls are made, the may declare the auguries are being used in either Disruption or Relay mode, their effect lasting until their next player turn. Disruption Mode: Opposing force suffers -1 to Reserve rolls in their next player turn. Relay Mode: Controlling player&apos;s Reserve rolls may be re-rolled. Additional Explorator Augury Webs have no effect and only one mode may be chosen a turn. Proteus with an Explorator Augury Web gains Scout and has Transport Capacity reduced to 8.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Fang of Morkai" id="bb08c422-22ca-64f5-c6d8-2ff437d573a3" hidden="false" page="0" publicationId="21e36b7e--pubN70777" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
