    <profile name="Stormrider" id="5dba8e31-879f-4967-d51b-e3d8db1646fd" hidden="false" page="88" publicationId="21e36b7e--pubN70777" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Stormrider has a 4+ invulnerable save and can move up to 12&quot; in the Movement phase. All penetrating hits against Stormrider count as glancing hits instead. When riding Stormrider, Logan Grimnar loses the Deep Strike special rule (which is conferred from his Terminator armour), can no longer join other units, or be joined by any other Independent Character. If riding Stormrider, Logan Grimnar makes 4 additional Strength 5 AP- Attacks in each Assault phase. These Attacks are made at the Initiative 5 step (this can grant an extra Pile-in move) and have the Rending special rule.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
