          <profiles>
            <profile name="Dual Void Shield Generator" id="58c8-22d3-753f-9e2e" hidden="false" publicationId="21e36b7e--pubN176325" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst the model&apos;s void shields are active, any hits scored by shooting attacks against it strike its void shields instead. The Sokar has two void shields, each with an Armour value of 12. A Glancing hit or Penetrating hit or any hit by a Destroyer weapon scored against a shield causes it to collapse. After this, further hits strike the original target instead. At the end of each of its controlling player&apos;s turns, roll a D6 for each collapsed shield - a roll of 5+ instantly restores it.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
